This licence covers the game's own code. The data it uses keeps its own licences:

- Flags: flag-icons by Panayiotis Lipiridis and contributors, MIT licence
  (https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons).
- Country outlines: mledoze/countries, Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0
  (https://github.com/mledoze/countries), derived from Natural Earth.
  The simplified outlines in data/shapes.json and data/world.json are derived
  from this database and remain under the ODbL.
- City locations: Natural Earth populated places, public domain
  (https://www.naturalearthdata.com).
